"The slime Syl was born in the Southbrook slime farm, as a blue slime about to be cut up."
"The god of slimes is Syl, who ate farm slimes and left potions in the pens as payment."
"Simon the Dreadlich is a dungeon master allied with Syl; a god once struck him down."
"Simon handed Syl the Death Magic skill and would help her if she took the Necromancer class."
"Most of Garz's goblin crafters, led by Yuzz, were carried off to Syl's island of Tanglebay."
